  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(291, 138, 353)\n\n__**(291 + 138)**__ - 76 = 353\n\n__**429 - 76**__ = 353\n\n353 = 353 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(178, 154, 256) \n\n__(291 + 138)__ - 76 = 353\n\n__429 - 76__ = 353\n\n353 = 353 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (410, 104, 428) \n\n__(410 + 104)__ - 76 = 428\n\n__514 - 76__ = 428\n\n438 ≠ 428 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (331, 197, 452)\n\n__(331 + 197)__ - 76 = 452\n\n__528 - 76__ = 353\n\n**452 = 452 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) (125, 136, 191)\n\n__(125 + 136)__ - 76 = 191\n\n__261 - 76__ = 191\n\n185 ≠ 191 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (206, 148, 280)\n\n__(206 + 148)__ - 76 = 280\n\n__354 - 76__ = 280\n\n278 ≠ 280 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '(331, 197, 452)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
